# MorphGNT working copy — a build-time VALIDATOR for the alignment dataset, not
# a dependency and not redistributed. Its lemmatization is CC BY-SA 3.0 and the
# SBLGNT text carries its own EULA, so the corpus and the lemma work-list it
# produces stay out of the repo. See The Alignment Dataset in CLAUDE.md.
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/morphgnt/sblgnt.git .morphgnt
.morphgnt/
alignment-coverage.json

# scripts/reconcile/ — one-off Word-master reconciliation tooling (see its
# README). out/ is regenerated scratch output (gate reports, the ledger, its
# per-book Markdown); the tooling's source and tests under lib/ and test/
# ARE committed, only this directory is not.
scripts/reconcile/out/
